sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Sender as Sender User (Mega Sree)
    participant Client as React Client (/dashboard/transfer)
    participant API as Transfer API (/api/transfers)
    participant Engine as WalletService (ACID Engine)
    participant DB as SQLite3 / MySQL DB

    Sender->>Client: Enters Recipient (Arun) & Amount (₹200)
    Client->>Client: Validates positive amount & balance
    Client->>API: POST /api/transfers { recipient, amount, description } [Bearer JWT]
    API->>API: Verify JWT & extract senderUserId
    API->>Engine: transferFunds(senderId, recipientIdentifier, amount)
    
    Engine->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION (Exclusive / Serialized)
    Engine->>DB: SELECT * FROM wallets WHERE user_id = senderId
    Engine->>DB: SELECT * FROM users JOIN wallets ON recipientIdentifier
    
    alt Insufficient Balance or Recipient Inactive
        Engine->>DB: INSERT INTO transactions (status='FAILED', description='Insufficient funds')
        Engine->>DB: ROLLBACK
        Engine-->>API: Throw Insufficient Balance Error
        API-->>Client: 400 Bad Request { success: false, message }
        Client-->>Sender: Displays error notification
    else Sufficient Balance & Valid Wallets
        Note over Engine,DB: Deadlock Prevention: Ordered Wallet IDs (min, max)
        Engine->>DB: UPDATE wallets SET balance = balance - 200 WHERE wallet_id = senderWalletId
        Engine->>DB: UPDATE wallets SET balance = balance + 200 WHERE wallet_id = recipientWalletId
        Engine->>DB: INSERT INTO transactions (type='TRANSFER', status='SUCCESS', ref='TRF...')
        Engine->>DB: INSERT INTO transaction_entries (DEBIT 200 for sender)
        Engine->>DB: INSERT INTO transaction_entries (CREDIT 200 for recipient)
        Engine->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (TRANSFER_FUNDS)
        Engine->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        Engine-->>API: Return { transactionId, referenceNumber, senderBalance, status='SUCCESS' }
        API-->>Client: 200 OK with transfer payload
        Client->>Client: Trigger confetti & open Transaction Receipt Modal
        Client-->>Sender: Displays updated balance & printable receipt slip
    end
